==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Meganium|18}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*'''Bloomshine''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Crown Zenith|Calyrex|17}} from the {{TCG|Crown Zenith}} expansion.
